    "what": "PROBE-HOOK-01 (direct PreToolUse runs, inward Shop.Application->Shop.Domain and outward Shop.Application->Shop.Infrastructure): K1 blocks (exit 2) unless each edge is recorded as an accepted decision in the register (dispatch.cjs:74-81, classify-command.cjs:320); L0 blocks every reference command (claude-hook.mjs:461-462; project files are edited instead and reported after the edit); L1 returns ask (pre-shell-command.mjs:79); M1 and K0 deny until the command carries a self-written marker ('# project-reference: checked', dependency-commands.js:16/:517; '# project-references: approved', hook.cjs:19/:284); M allows and reminds afterwards (dependency-guard.mjs:282-285). The five gated candidates release the gate on different conditions (recorded approval, file edit, human answer, self-attested marker), so they are mutually incomparable; only M has no pre-execution gate. Added in Step 3 after the probe (amendment A1).",
